    "description": "The Telecom SIM Portability API facilitates seamless request submissions for porting mobile numbers between telecom service providers. This service is essential for users looking to maintain their existing phone numbers while switching providers, ensuring minimal disruption in service. Typically used by telecom operators and mobile service applications, this API allows for easy integration and management of portability requests. It streamlines the process to enhance customer experience and operational efficiency in the telecom industry.",
